flowchart TD
    A([Reader]) -->|pencil icon| B[Editor]
    B --> C[Pick a tool: highlight, pen, text,<br/>image, shape, signature, eraser]
    C --> D[Mark up the page<br/>undo and redo up to 100 steps]
    D --> E{Save or leave?}
    E -->|Save| F{Can the original<br/>file be changed?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Write into the original]
    F -->|No, e.g. from email| H[Choose where to save a copy]
    E -->|Save as a copy| H
    H --> I[Open the new copy]
    E -->|Back with unsaved changes| J{Unsaved changes dialog}
    J -->|Save| F
    J -->|Discard| K([Leave without saving])
    J -->|Cancel| D
    G --> L([Back in the reader])
    I --> L
